             v  logs in, and runs commands there
        port1.0.2
    +---------------------------------------------------------+
    |  swi_b   AT-x960-28YSQ                                   |
    |  the SSH SERVER the client connects to                   |
    |  interface vlan60 10.38.22.98/27                         |
